              START WITH THE JOB.
            </h2>
          </div>

          <p class="section-intro">
            No elaborate intake process. Give us enough to understand what
            you're looking at and we'll start there.
          </p>
        </div>


        <div class="steps">

          <div
            class="step"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: 0s"
          >
            <span class="step-number">01</span>

            <div>
              <h3>Send the Drawing</h3>

              <p>
                PDF. DXF. Dimensions. Sketch. Photograph.
                Whatever tells the story.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div
            class="step"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: .08s"
          >
